    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a \"new shape\" though. it just feels like the well is dry. i look at people living their lives and i just feel like a ghost watching a movie. like i've finished my part and now i'm just... waiting for the credits to roll. but there are no credits. it's just more of this gray nothing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
